 REINDEX INDEX rrd.docs_col                        | ERROR: permission denied for index docs_col  | rrd_other, rrd_writer, rrd_reader, rrd_none
 REINDEX TABLE rrd.facts                           | ERROR: permission denied for table facts     | rrd_other, rrd_writer, rrd_reader, rrd_none
 ALTER INDEX rrd.docs_idx RENAME TO x              | ERROR: must be owner of index docs_idx       | rrd_other, rrd_writer, rrd_reader, rrd_none
 ALTER TABLE rrd.docs ADD COLUMN z int             | ERROR: must be owner of table docs           | rrd_other, rrd_writer, rrd_reader, rrd_none
 ALTER TABLE rrd.facts ADD COLUMN z int            | ERROR: must be owner of table facts          | rrd_other, rrd_writer, rrd_reader, rrd_none
